
RTK configured for Codex CLI.

  RTK.md:    RTK.md
  Hook:      .codex/hooks.json (already present)
  AGENTS.md: @RTK.md reference already present

  Codex project instructions path: AGENTS.md

  Restart Codex. For a project hook, approve it when Codex asks you to trust it.

  Optional: if history recording fails with SQLITE_CANTOPEN in the
  workspace-write sandbox, grant write access to the tracking directory:

sandbox_mode = "workspace-write"

[sandbox_workspace_write]
writable_roots = ["/private/tmp/rtkhome-codex-l/Library/Application Support/rtk"]

  Merge this into Codex config.toml only if you want persistent history.
  Keep existing writable_roots; do not add a duplicate table.
  This grants access to the directory, including SQLite sidecar files.
  No Codex permission settings have been changed.

